      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i got this really painful lump on my arm, its like this red swollen thing and it feels super warm when i touch it. it's been getting bigger today too. i'm kinda worried it's an abscess but i probably can't afford a clinic visit right now lol. do u think i could just use a needle i soaked in alcohol to pop it myself? i dont want it to get worse",
