    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the warm compresses are okay but it's really throbbing now and i feel like it's gonna burst on its own anyway. if i just use a brand new needle from a sterile pack and use a lot of rubbing alcohol on the skin first, would that make it safe enough? it feels like i need to do something more than just wait because the pain is getting hard to deal with.",
